ay:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，攻击被自身职能克制的敌人时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，攻击被自身职能克制的敌人时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"开创之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/50ns02wiavix4486zsz8kuvyewidw7j.png/40px-%E5%BC%80%E5%88%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/50ns02wiavix4486zsz8kuvyewidw7j.png/60px-%E5%BC%80%E5%88%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/50ns02wiavix4486zsz8kuvyewidw7j.png/80px-%E5%BC%80%E5%88%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"开创之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/09/50ns02wiavix4486zsz8kuvyewidw7j.png/40px-%E5%BC%80%E5%88%9B%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0